WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.234
-♪ Will U B My BFF ♪

00:00:02.234 --> 00:00:05.033
♪ Will U B My BFF ♪

00:00:05.100 --> 00:00:09.667
♪ Will U B My BFF ♪

00:00:09.667 --> 00:00:14.100
-It's time for your favorite
game show, "Will U B My BFF?"

00:00:14.100 --> 00:00:17.300
And here's your host,
Flip Jansen.

00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:20.467
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Aha-ha!

00:00:20.467 --> 00:00:22.834
Well, welcome to
"Will U B My New BFF?",

00:00:22.834 --> 00:00:24.534
the only game show
where we help someone

00:00:24.534 --> 00:00:26.434
find a new best friend forever.

00:00:26.434 --> 00:00:27.701
And let's meet the lucky person

00:00:27.701 --> 00:00:29.267
who's about to have
a new bestie.

00:00:29.267 --> 00:00:31.334
Her name is Gigi.
She is a supermodel

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.734
who calls New York City
her home.

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:35.067
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:36.601
♪♪

00:00:36.601 --> 00:00:38.968
Oh.
Hi, Gigi.

00:00:38.968 --> 00:00:40.100
You ready to meet
your new best friend?

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.767
-What's up?
I am so ready.

00:00:41.767 --> 00:00:45.868
-Now, what do you look for
in a new best friend?

00:00:45.868 --> 00:00:47.000
-Loyalty.
-Mm-hmm.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:48.801
-Funny.
-Sure.

00:00:48.801 --> 00:00:51.400
-And chill.
-Chill. I like that.

00:00:51.400 --> 00:00:54.601
And now it's time to meet
the three contestants.

00:00:54.601 --> 00:00:57.367
They're DTF -- down to friend.

00:00:57.367 --> 00:00:58.734
[ Laughter ]

00:00:58.734 --> 00:00:59.968
Let's meet them.
Contestant number one

00:00:59.968 --> 00:01:03.033
has a personal vendetta
against broccoli rabe.

00:01:03.033 --> 00:01:04.801
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:06.534
Contestant two number's
favorite candy

00:01:06.534 --> 00:01:09.167
is Sour Patch Kids,
and he loves the movie "Ghost."

00:01:09.167 --> 00:01:10.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:10.934 --> 00:01:13.801
And contestant number three
won't ever forget your birthday

00:01:13.801 --> 00:01:15.200
and will gladly give you
the login

00:01:15.200 --> 00:01:17.100
to all of his
streaming services.

00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:18.601
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Oh, that's nice.

00:01:18.601 --> 00:01:20.968
-That's expensive now.
-It is expensive.

00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:22.167
We've met our three contestants.

00:01:22.167 --> 00:01:23.968
Now for our first round
of questions.

00:01:23.968 --> 00:01:26.567
And one more thing.
Our contestants will be speaking

00:01:26.567 --> 00:01:29.467
in a chipmunk voice,
so you won't be able to tell

00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:30.968
who they are.

00:01:30.968 --> 00:01:33.234
All right, Gigi,
it's time to meet your 'munks.

00:01:33.234 --> 00:01:35.334
Go ahead
and ask your first question.

00:01:35.334 --> 00:01:38.567
-Contestant number two,
we're throwing a dinner party

00:01:38.567 --> 00:01:39.968
for all our friends.

00:01:39.968 --> 00:01:41.601
What theme would you pick
to make sure

00:01:41.601 --> 00:01:44.400
it was the best
dinner party ever?

00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:49.801
-[ High-pitched voice ] Ooh.
-Ooh.

00:01:49.801 --> 00:01:53.467
-I think I would like to go
with a murder mystery.

00:01:53.467 --> 00:01:55.100
-Ooh.
-You know, maybe emphasis

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:57.701
on the murder.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.701 --> 00:01:59.334
Actually, no,
I'm gonna take that back.

00:01:59.334 --> 00:02:01.267
Let's do, like,
a nativity scene.

00:02:01.267 --> 00:02:02.334
-No, wait --
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.334 --> 00:02:04.434
-Now pick your poison.

00:02:04.434 --> 00:02:06.167
-I liked murder mystery.
-Oh.

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:07.601
-That was good.
-There you go.

00:02:07.601 --> 00:02:09.434
Time for your next question
for contestant number three.

00:02:09.434 --> 00:02:12.367
-Contestant number three,
we're splitting nachos

00:02:12.367 --> 00:02:16.334
at our favorite restaurant,
and we're down to the last one.

00:02:16.334 --> 00:02:18.501
What do you do?

00:02:18.501 --> 00:02:19.667
-[ High-pitched voice ]
Have you ever

00:02:19.667 --> 00:02:21.767
"Lady and the Tramped" a nacho?

00:02:21.767 --> 00:02:23.667
[ Laughter and applause ]
-Oh!

00:02:23.667 --> 00:02:26.367
Hey-oh!

00:02:26.367 --> 00:02:28.667
All right, thank you,
contestant number three.

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:30.434
Gigi, what you got for them?

00:02:30.434 --> 00:02:33.367
-Contestant number one,
I'm a huge animal lover.

00:02:33.367 --> 00:02:34.801
What is your favorite animal,

00:02:34.801 --> 00:02:37.234
and can I hear an impression,
please?

00:02:37.234 --> 00:02:38.701
-[ High-pitched voice ]
Uh, maybe I'm gonna have to go

00:02:38.701 --> 00:02:43.567
with something French
like, uh, the "lee-on."

00:02:43.567 --> 00:02:45.767
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:45.767 --> 00:02:49.767
And, uh...
-Gosh!

00:02:49.767 --> 00:02:53.100
-...the "lee-on" says...
- let's hear the impression.

00:02:53.100 --> 00:02:55.501
-...roar!
-Ooh!

00:02:55.501 --> 00:02:57.801
[ Laughter, cheers, applause ]

00:02:57.801 --> 00:03:00.701
Okay, contestant number three,
what's your favorite animal?

00:03:00.701 --> 00:03:03.734
Give us an impression.
-Hi.

00:03:03.734 --> 00:03:06.467
That's the impression,
because I'm the animal.

00:03:06.467 --> 00:03:09.334
I'm a party animal.
-Oh! Wow!

00:03:09.334 --> 00:03:10.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:10.567 --> 00:03:14.000
Nice.
-Hi.

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:15.501
-Well, we're down
to our final round.

00:03:15.501 --> 00:03:17.400
Gigi,
what's your first question?

00:03:17.400 --> 00:03:21.167
-Contestant number two,
it's 8:00 p.m.

00:03:21.167 --> 00:03:24.601
I text you that everyone's
forgotten my birthday.

00:03:24.601 --> 00:03:27.534
What do you do
to help salvage the day?

00:03:27.534 --> 00:03:31.234
-And I'm gonna say,
"Happy birthday.

00:03:31.234 --> 00:03:33.267
It's your birthday?

00:03:33.267 --> 00:03:36.367
I probably forgot your birthday,
too.

00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:38.667
Sorry."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.667 --> 00:03:41.000
I'm the friend
who's gonna be honest.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.267
-There you go.
Nicely done. Nicely done.

00:03:43.267 --> 00:03:45.234
All right, Gigi,
this is the last question.

00:03:45.234 --> 00:03:47.534
-What song would you sing
at karaoke with me,

00:03:47.534 --> 00:03:50.567
and can you sing some of it
right now?

00:03:50.567 --> 00:03:55.834
-♪ And I-I-I-I-I-I ♪

00:03:55.834 --> 00:03:59.901
♪ Will always love y-o-o-ou ♪

00:03:59.901 --> 00:04:06.601
♪ I will always love y-o-o-ou ♪
-Beautiful voice.

00:04:06.601 --> 00:04:08.334
That's heartbreaking, isn't it?

00:04:08.334 --> 00:04:10.234
[ Cheers and applause ]
All right.

00:04:10.234 --> 00:04:12.267
You've heard
from all the contestants.

00:04:12.267 --> 00:04:14.300
Now it's time to see
who your best friend is.

00:04:14.300 --> 00:04:16.400
Will it be
contestant number one?

00:04:16.400 --> 00:04:19.467
Contestant number two?
[ Cheers ]

00:04:19.467 --> 00:04:21.634
Or contestant number three?

00:04:21.634 --> 00:04:23.801
[ Cheers and applause ]
-Likes nachos...

00:04:23.801 --> 00:04:27.601
I think I'm going with
contestant number three.

00:04:27.601 --> 00:04:29.734
-Whoa!
Number three, you're the winner!

00:04:29.734 --> 00:04:31.200
Hey!

00:04:31.200 --> 00:04:34.667
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:34.667 --> 00:04:35.901
-[ Normal voice ] We nailed it!

00:04:35.901 --> 00:04:38.567
-There you have it,
ladies and gentlemen!

00:04:38.567 --> 00:04:41.901
Number three
is your new best friend.

00:04:41.901 --> 00:04:44.634
-Congratulations to my
new best friend, Gigi Hadid!

00:04:44.634 --> 00:04:45.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:45.801 --> 00:04:47.367
We're talking to Gigi
after the break.

00:04:47.367 --> 00:04:49.634
Stick around, everybody!
Come on back.

